  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9404.02 Individual Form, DSSP 457.\n\n(a) Pursuant to Saf-C 9404.01(b)(6), every application by a tow business to be placed on the division’s tow list, shall be accompanied with a completed DSSP 457, “New Hampshire Tow List – Individual”, revised 01/2023 for each of the businesses’:\n\n(1) Tow truck operator;\n\n(2) Tow business owner;\n\n(3) Tow business manager; and\n\n(4) Tow business supervisor.\n\n(b) The DSSP 457 form, revised 01/2023, shall be completed by the individual operator, owner, manager or supervisor and signed by the individual under penalties of unsworn falsification pursuant to RSA 641:3. By signing the DSSP 457, “New Hampshire Tow List – Individual”, revised 01/2023, the signatory is certifying that the information on the application is true and accurate.\n\nSource. #13550, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-31-23, EXPIRES: 7-30-23; ss by #13653, eff 5-26-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9400.html"
